    Occasionally you glace over at <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span> and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ethan</span>. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span> seems absorbed in the film, his eyes moving back and forth as if trying to study every detail. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ethan</span> is rather aloof, but he does have one hand that clings to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span>’ arm.  Periodically, you sense <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span> turning his head over to you, as if checking on something, before looking back at the screen.  <br>
    <br>
    About 75% of the way into the movie, you realize that <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ethan</span> had fallen asleep. <span style="color:pink">He is curled up in the seat like a dog. He is even sucking his thumb and has his other hand still wrapped around <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span>’. The scene is so cute, you could die. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span> seems to notice his brother as well, smiling and patting the boy on the head before continuing to watch the movie.</span>   <br>

